This Project is a simple physics engine written in C using the raylib framework.

I am using Zanzlanz's video "Coding a Physics Engine from Scratch!" on YouTube as a sort of guide and am adapting it in C.

AI disclosure:
Most of this code base is written by hand, however for some issues I have used claude to help figure out bugs, explaining code, and figuring out technical issues.
But I still try to understand my codebase by writting what claude tell me itself and I try to avoid copy and pasteing.
